  "description": "The 6 robust scarifier shanks, providing a powerful and efficient solution for tilling tough ground, without the inclusion of the implement lift system.\nFitment\n6 Scarifier Shank Fits ATV/UTV Manual Implement Lift ATV/UTV Plow Implement\nFeatures\nSave time and energy:\nWith 6 scarifier shanks, this cultivator is designed to make tilling tough ground a breeze. Spend less time and energy on manual labor and more time enjoying your garden or farm.\nPerfectly adaptable:\nThe depth adjustments on this cultivator allow for optimal performance in multiple tillage conditions. Whether you need to cultivate deep or shallow, this tool has got you covered.\nCompatible with ATV/UTV manual implement lift 1-point lift system:\nThis cultivator is easy to use and can be used with 1-point manual implement lift systems. Make the most out of your equipment with this versatile tool.\nRust-resistant coating:\nThe all-steel design of this cultivator, coupled with a black rust-resistant coated finish, ensures it will last season after season. Don't let rust slow you down - choose a tool that's built to last.\nDurable construction:\nThe detachable cultivator with 6 scarifier shanks is built to tackle tough soil with ease. Upgraded for optimal performance, you can count on this tool to get the job done.",
